    "preamble": "M.V Srinivasa Rao vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 12 November, 2019 Honourable Sri Justice D.V.S.S. Somayajulu Criminal Petition No.6822 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioners under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure to quash the proceedings against the petitioners, in FIR No.245 of 2019 on the file of Sub- Inspector of Police, II Town Police Station, Tenali, Guntur District.",
    "arguments": "Heard Sri Raja Reddy Koneti, learned counsel for the petitioners and the learned Public Prosecutor appearing for the respondent-State. Both the counsel agree that this matter is squarely covered by the judgment of the single Judge in the batch petitions bearing Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018 and others.",
